  {
   "id": "ratshaker-321428@major-2026-06-21",
   "gameId": "ratshaker-321428",
   "displayName": "RATSHAKER™ - THE RATDOG RITUAL UPDATE (+ a new plushie)",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-06-21T19:09:21.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey RATSHAKERs,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "THE RATDOG UPDATE HAS ARRIVED.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Step outside the house and find the hotdog sigil.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Stand on it.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🌭 THE RATDOG RITUAL EXPERIENCE",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45258209/332597efddec7d5dd291a269fb5234bd79875ffb.gif\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A new hotdog-making minigame has been added outside the house.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Open the fridge.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Take the sausage.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Grill the sausage.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Summon the bun.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Prepare the tray.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "RAT. DOG.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "When the sausage and bun are ready, condiments will fall from the heavens and the new skin will be yours.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🧸 RATDOG YOUTOOZ PLUSHIE",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45258209/d4fff3b7ba2eb3742ce4d31f55b9477272edc6db.png\"]Ratdog has also escaped the screen.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "\"Nothing says summertime like a hotdog-shaped rat, or is it a rat-shaped hot dog? Either way, you probably shouldn't eat this plush, no matter how delicious it looks! At 9 inches tall, this perfectly cooked red rat that has pained face and squiggle of mustard down their belly as they're wrapped tightly in a golden brown hotdog bun. They're not just for shaking either, give this rat a big old squeeze to activate the soundbox inside to let them blurt out a few hilarious catchphrases!\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "👨‍🍳 NEW FREE RATDOG CHEF SKIN",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Complete the Ratdog Cookout to unlock the new RATDOG CHEF skin.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "You do not need money.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "You only need to complete the ritual.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45258209/eed9aff1264378f0ef8fabbbf93d428ef64becd5.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "The Ratdog Cookout features",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "\"Ready Aim Fire\" by Kevin MacLeod (incompetech.com)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Licensed under Creative Commons: By Attribution 4.0 License",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "👕 RAT-CHAN T-SHIRT",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "RAT-CHAN is now on a t-shirt (and tote bags)!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "\"It’s a t-shirt with Rat-Chan on it. UwU I guess.\"",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45258209/5b3e8de6ff6a0f6a5dad6ddab83690c293de6b42.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "It’s going to be a RAT summer...",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "HAVE A RATRATRATRATRATRATRAT-TASTIC DAY!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Make sure to restart Steam to apply this update.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Keep shaking that RAT! 🐀💕",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sunscorched Studios: No real rats were harmed in the development of RATSHAKER™ but many aliens were.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
