  {
   "id": "ratshaker-321428@post-2025-01-13",
   "gameId": "ratshaker-321428",
   "displayName": "RATSHAKER™ 13_01_25_01 - DX11 Support",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2025-01-13T12:52:15.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey RATSHAKERs,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We're now packaging compiled shaders for DX11 & SM5 with RATSHAKER.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Unreal Engine 5, does not do this by default, but this should resolve the error message for RATSHAKERs attempting to run the game on hardware below the minimum spec. Please let us know if this is the case in the following steam discussion thread:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This does not mean the game will run well (or work properly)!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You may experience strange behaviour, missing models, broken lighting etc.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We are not able to provide technical support for hardware below our minimum stated specifications.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We've also identified an issue that causes the RAT to \"stutter\" when screaming. This occurs when the framerate of the game goes above 60fps. It seems the screaming rat logic is not framerate independent, like it should be (and the rest of the game is). We're looking into this and will let you know when a fix is issued. In the meantime, you can prevent this behaviour by enabling vsync & forcing the refresh rate to be 60fps.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Finally, the Christmas update has now been disabled. We hope you enjoyed your present from the RAT.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Please restart steam to ensure you get this update!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Keep shaking that RAT! 🐀",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
